---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Discovery - Soustack Specification">
  <h1>Discovery</h1>
  
  <div class="section">
    <p><strong>Note:</strong> The following discovery pattern is recommended but non-normative.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>HTML Link Element</h2>
    <p>Publishers may include a link element in HTML documents to indicate the presence of a Soustack document:</p>
    <pre><code>&lt;link rel="alternate" type="application/vnd.soustack+json" href="/soustack/recipes/&lt;slug&gt;.soustack.json"&gt;</code></pre>
    <p>This allows automated tooling to discover Soustack documents associated with web pages.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Media Type</h2>
    <p>The recommended media type for Soustack documents is:</p>
    <pre><code>application/vnd.soustack+json</code></pre>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

